    - target: {fileID: 4515043531239127390, guid: 9f471d098f311684a86f2d61b4f857f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: content
      value: 'Srata tata, some mage research on strange cultures living in the west,
        that created a special code language alowing them to speak with numbers.
        "Maybe if i would swap space from 1 to removal of last character, it would
        work well as a part of password mechanism" [TEMP]


        +--------+--------+--------+

        |     
        1       |     2      |      3      |

        |      -       |  ABC   |  
        DEF   |

        +--------+--------+--------+

        |      4       |     
        5     |      6      |

        |   GHI    |    JKL   |  MNO  |

        +--------+--------+--------+

        |      
        7      |     8      |       9     |

        |  PQRS  |  TUV   | WXYZ |

        +--------+--------+--------+'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
